Z||000019||fiero56||12-03-1999||08:36 PM||||It looks like the 120MPH speedo and the rally guages were added in '86. In '86 the v-6 SE got the rally guages, but kept the 85MPH speedo. The GT got the rally guages and a 120MPH speedo. In '87 and '88 Feiros, all v-6 equipped cars had the rally guages and 120MPH speedo. Apparently there was no 120MPH speedo or rally guages in '84-'85.  All information is from my Fiero spotters guide.||||reg||1
